# CLAUDE.md is Claude Code's project briefing. Deliberately NOT committed:
# this repo is public, and the file holds working notes and project state
# that do not need publishing. Claude Code reads it from the working
# directory, so it still works untracked - but keep a personal backup,
# because a fresh clone will not have it.
